            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&#xa;ABOUT THE COURSE:&#xa;B.COM Honors is a three year under graduate course modeled to offer the student with a number of &#xa;management skills and at the same time also building in them profeiciently in a specific area B.Com &#xa;Honors  at bareilly college is designed to provide the student with a wide range of managerial skills &#xa;while at the same time building competence in a particular area.&#xa;&#xa;Highlights:&#xa;&gt;Regular industry interaction&#xa;&gt;Guest lectures by experts&#xa;&gt;A well-stocked library&#xa;&gt;personality development sessions&#xa;&gt;Extra curicullar activities through B.COM.Honors UG forum&#xa;&gt;Online classes&#xa;&gt;Scolership directly in students account.&#xa;                                                                         &#xa;                                                            :: For Admission Related Information Contact on the following ::&#xa;                                                                                                          Dr. Priyank mehrotra&#xa;                                                                                                  In-Charge,B.Com.Honors                                                                      &#xa;                                                                                                  Bareilly College,Bareilly&#xa;                                                                                                       Mob No: 7668139992&#xa;                                                                &#xa;                                         Office Contact:                     Mr.Pankaj Agarwal:9927288998&#xa;                                                                                              Dr.Sarvendra Mishra:9412066878&#xa;"/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
